 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls**
-*   **Non-opaque Surfaces:** Standard depth priors fail on glass/mirrors because they assume a single depth mode. SCADE handles this by modeling multimodal distributions (e.g., depth through glass, on glass, or mixture) [S1].
